{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cnn filter bank cnn filter bank","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md","fileName":"CNN Filter Bank.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"CNN Filter Bank","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 02:14\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Convolutional Visual Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Convolutional Visual Architecture","Convolutional Kernel","Convolutional Feature Map","CNN Dense Layer Integration","Convolutional Weight Sharing","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cnn filter bank cnn filter bank","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md","fileName":"CNN Filter Bank.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"CNN Filter Bank","heading":"CNN Filter Bank","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"One [[Convolutional Kernel]] detects one kind of local pattern. A convolutional network therefore trains multiple kernels, or filters, in parallel when it needs to detect different visual features. Each filter produces its own [[Convolutional Feature Map]], and the maps can be assembled into a multifilter representation.\n\nA later convolutional layer may analyze that combined representation, or a [[CNN Dense Layer Integration|dense layer]] may combine all filter outputs to make a final decision. The bank expands what the network can represent without abandoning [[Convolutional Weight Sharing]] within each individual filter.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Convolutional Visual Architecture","Convolutional Kernel","Convolutional Feature Map","CNN Dense Layer Integration","Convolutional Weight Sharing","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cnn filter bank cnn filter bank","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/CNN Filter Bank.md","fileName":"CNN Filter Bank.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"CNN Filter Bank","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[deeplearning_mit.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Convolutional Visual Architecture","Convolutional Kernel","Convolutional Feature Map","CNN Dense Layer Integration","Convolutional Weight Sharing","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}